---
---
<section id="hero" class="relative h-screen w-full bg-black overflow-hidden">

            <!-- Slides -->
            <div id="slider-track" class="relative w-full h-full">

                <!-- Slide 1 -->
                <div class="slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-100" data-index="0">
                    <img src="/assets/img/penromedia_herosection.avif" alt="Fotografer" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[93%_center] md:object-center">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/85 via-black/30 to-transparent"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Slide 2 -->
                <div class="slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-0" data-index="1">
                    <img src="/assets/img/slider_02_javanese_wedding.jpg" alt="Pernikahan Adat Jawa" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/85 via-black/30 to-transparent"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Slide 3 -->
                <div class="slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-0" data-index="2">
                    <img src="/assets/img/slider_03_sundanese_wedding.jpg" alt="Pernikahan Adat Sunda" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/85 via-black/30 to-transparent"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Slide 4 -->
                <div class="slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-0" data-index="3">
                    <img src="/assets/img/slider_04_city_lights.jpg" alt="City Lights Photography" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[65%_center] md:object-center">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/85 via-black/30 to-transparent"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Slide 5 -->
                <div class="slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-0" data-index="4">
                    <img src="/assets/img/slider_05_strobist.jpg" alt="Strobist Photography" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/85 via-black/30 to-transparent"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- Content Overlay -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end pb-24 md:pb-32 z-10">
                <div class="px-6 md:pl-20 lg:pl-28 w-full">

                    <!-- Slide Texts -->
                    <div id="slide-texts" class="mb-8 min-h-[120px]">
                        <div class="slide-text block" data-index="0">
                            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-3 tracking-tight leading-tight">Kami Merekam Apa<br>yang Tak Bisa Diulang</h1>
                            <p class="text-white/60 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">Dari sesi prewedding hingga undangan digital — setiap detail dirancang dengan niat, bukan sekadar dikerjakan.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="slide-text hidden" data-index="1">
                            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-3 tracking-tight leading-tight">Sakralnya Adat Jawa,<br>Abadi dalam Lensa Kami</h1>
                            <p class="text-white/60 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">Setiap detail kebaya dan beskap terekam utuh — karena momen seperti ini tak datang dua kali.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="slide-text hidden" data-index="2">
                            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-3 tracking-tight leading-tight">Keanggunan Sunda,<br>Terasa dalam Setiap Frame</h1>
                            <p class="text-white/60 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">Dari siger hingga senyum tulus — kami hadir bukan hanya sebagai fotografer, tapi saksi hari terbaik Anda.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="slide-text hidden" data-index="3">
                            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-3 tracking-tight leading-tight">Gemerlap Lampu Kota,<br>Menyala Dalam Gelap</h1>
                            <p class="text-white/60 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">Bermain dengan cahaya dan bayangan — menangkap harmoni sempurna antara subjek dan keindahan lanskap malam.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="slide-text hidden" data-index="4">
                            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-3 tracking-tight leading-tight">Tajam dan Berkarakter<br>Lewat Teknik Strobist</h1>
                            <p class="text-white/60 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">Bukan sekadar pencahayaan biasa. Kami mendesain cahaya untuk menciptakan dimensi dan mood sinematik di setiap jepretan.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center mb-14">
                        <a href="#about" class="text-gold text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase hover:text-white transition-all flex items-center">
                            BACA LEBIH LANJUT <svg class="w-3 h-3 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slider Pagination with SVG Timer -->
                    <div class="flex space-x-3 items-center" id="pagination">
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
    </section>